.TH AVR\-REPO\-PUBLIC\-MIRROR\-CANCEL 1 "" "avr 0.3.0" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-repo-public-mirror-cancel \- Cancel one pending public-mirror request.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr repo public-mirror cancel
[OPTIONS] REQUEST_ID
.SH DESCRIPTION
Cancel one pending public-mirror request.
.PP
An approved mirror is global and cannot be withdrawn by a requester.
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
Examples:
    avr repo public-mirror cancel pmr-0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef
    avr repo public-mirror cancel pmr-0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef --yes
.fi
.RE
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
JSON FIELDS
    approval_state, created_at, github_snapshot, public_access_expires_at,
    reason, repository_full_name, repository_id, request_id,
    requester_organization_id, requester_user_id, review_note, reviewed_at,
    reviewed_by_user_id, status, updated_at
.fi
.RE
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
\fIREQUEST_ID\fR
\&
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID or slug. Uses default org if not specified (see: avr config set org).
.TP
\fB\-\-yes\fR, \fB\-y\fR
Skip the confirmation prompt.
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR \fITEXT\fR
Output JSON. Pass comma-separated field names, "*" for all fields, or "?" to list available fields.
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-jq\fR \fITEXT\fR
Filter --json output through a jq expression.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-repo-public-mirror (1),
.BR avr-repo-public-mirror-check (1),
.BR avr-repo-public-mirror-request (1),
.BR avr-repo-public-mirror-requests (1),
.BR avr-repo-public-mirror-view (1)
